    printf("3DS CONTROLS\nCircle Pad: steer  A: accelerate\nB: brake  R: hop/drift  L: use item\nD-pad: trick / bike wheelie\nSTART: maps/pause  SELECT: restart\nX/Y: character  B+X/Y: vehicle\n");
